{"code": "SS-Y1-T1-L01", "en": false, "slides": [{"bg": "1E3A3F", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 64, "y": 58, "w": 1152, "h": 58, "text": "الدِّراساتُ الاجْتِماعِيَّةُ وَالتَّرْبِيَةُ الأَخْلاقِيَّةُ · الصَّفُّ الأَوَّلُ · الوَحْدَةُ الأولى: الأُسْرَةُ الإِماراتِيَّةُ", "size": 25, "color": "F2A93B", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 128, "w": 832, "h": 134, "text": "أَنا وَأُسْرَتي", "size": 78, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 384, "y": 269, "w": 832, "h": 64, "text": "الدَّرْسُ الأَوَّلُ · أَوَّلًا: أَنا وَأُسْرَتي · كِتابي ص 10–17", "size": 28, "color": "CFE3E1", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "pic", "x": 77, "y": 122, "w": 269, "h": 294, "src": "resources/ss/g1/SS-Y1-T1-L01/hamad.webp", "rad": true}, {"k": "shape", "x": 64, "y": 442, "w": 1152, "h": 186, "fill": "27474D", "line": null, "rad": true, "oval": false, "lw": 1.5}, {"k": "text", "x": 90, "y": 454, "w": 1101, "h": 160, "text": "🎯 أَتَعَرَّفُ أَفْرادَ أُسْرَتي، وَأُعَرِّفُ بِنَفْسي، وَأَعْرِفُ أَنَّ عَدَدَ أَفْرادِ الأُسْرَةِ يَخْتَلِفُ مِنْ بَيْتٍ لِآخَرَ.", "size": 32, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": false, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "top"}], "n": "اقرأ العنوان بصوت واضح، واطلب من الطلاب فتح الكتاب على الصفحة."}, {"bg": "FBF6EC", "els": [{"k": "text", "x": 410, "y": 13, "w": 461, "h": 49, "text": "🔁 نتذكّر معًا", "size": 23, "color": "FFFFFF", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "0F6E72", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 38, "y": 74, "w": 173, "h": 54, "text": "⏱ 3 دقائق", "size": 23, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "center", "fill": "F2A93B", "rad": true, "va": "middle"}, {"k": "text", "x": 230, "y": 67, "w": 1011, "h": 77, "text": "مَنْ يَعيشُ مَعي؟", "size": 46, "color": "1E3A3F", "bold": true, "align": "right", "fill": null, "rad": false, "va": "mi